stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: upload / reprocess
  queued --> running: worker claims (atomic)
  running --> completed: pipeline finished
  running --> queued: transient error, attempts left<br/>(run_after = now + backoff)
  running --> failed: permanent error or attempts exhausted
  running --> queued: server restart (stuck job recovered)
  failed --> queued: POST /documents/{id}/reprocess<br/>or /jobs/retry-failed
  completed --> queued: POST /documents/{id}/reprocess
  completed --> [*]: DELETE /documents/{id}
  failed --> [*]: DELETE /documents/{id}
